    "unverified_targets": {
      "cursor": "Event preToolUse with matcher Write|Delete, the failClosed option and the permission, user_message and agent_message answer come from a snapshot of Cursor's hook page in a local outside project and match Cursor's hook page as read on September 24, 2026, which requires permission in every answer and blocks the action on an answer that does not match the schema; so an allowed write is answered with permission allow. Neither page documents the Write input field that holds the path; the hook reads file_path, then path, and refuses when neither exists. Whether an allow answer also skips Cursor's own approval is unverified. No Cursor run was observed.",
      "copilot": "Event preToolUse, the input fields toolName and toolArgs, the tool names create and edit, and the permissionDecision answer match GitHub's hooks configuration reference as read on September 24, 2026. The path field inside toolArgs is the producer's reading and was not confirmed there, and no Copilot run was observed."
    },
